  epo:hasAdditionalInformation "Pricing is as set out in the Taking Control of Goods (Fees) Regulations 2014. Prices for ancillary service requirements are as stated in the tender documents. Terms and conditions: the Council has opted to use its own terms and conditions. The terms and conditions are as stated in the tender documents."@en;
  epo:hasInternalIdentifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/f4308a76-5393-477c-ba91-f4c9fb8818a6-01/Procedure/Identifier/DPS%20%E2%80%94%20774>;
  epo:hasLegalBasis <http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/legal-basis/32014L0023>;
  epo:hasProcurementScopeDividedIntoLot <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/f4308a76-5393-477c-ba91-f4c9fb8818a6-01/Lot/LOT-0000>;
  epo:hasPurpose <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/f4308a76-5393-477c-ba91-f4c9fb8818a6-01/ProcedurePurpose$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProject1>;
  epo:isSubjectToTerm <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/f4308a76-5393-477c-ba91-f4c9fb8818a6-01/ProcedureTerm$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1>;
  dct:description "The Council of the Wakefield will be undertaking a call for further competition under the YPO Enforcement Agency Services DPS pursuant to the requirements of the Concession Contracts Regulations 2016 and the procedures laid down in the in the DPS to enter into a concession contract under which the Council will entrust the provision of the enforcement agency services to concessionaires in relation to debts accruing regarding non-payment of the outlined in II.2.4). Only those suppliers registered on the DPS will be invited to participate. The Council is looking to award one contract for first line referrals and one contract for second line referrals under service concession contracts. Successful suppliers must be able to provide all the service required as outlined in the ITB. Contracts will be for 1 year with the option to extend for a further three, 12 month period."@en;
  dct:title "Concession Contract for the Supply of Enforcement Agency Services (Call-off from the YPO Enforcement Services DPS — 774)"@en;
  adms:identifier <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/f4308a76-5393-477c-ba91-f4c9fb8818a6-01/Procedure/Identifier/37f6106b-c2e1-45f1-b88a-14888693ee36> .

